    "name": "frp Client Admin Clients Health API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The frp client (frpc) exposes a built-in HTTP admin API on its local web server. The API lets operators inspect or hot-reload the client configuration, stop the client, query proxy and visitor status, and (when a configuration store is enabled) manage stored proxy and visitor definitions. All routes (except /healthz) require HTTP Basic authentication using the user and password configured in webServer.user and webServer.password.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: frp",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
